18 // ADDR 0: LOAD from Addr 8 (Loads initial 0)
29 // ADDR 1: ADD from Addr 9 (Adds 1)
30 // ADDR 2: OUT (Displays 1)
29 // ADDR 3: ADD from Addr 9 (Adds 1)
30 // ADDR 4: OUT (Displays 2)
29 // ADDR 5: ADD from Addr 9 (Adds 1)
30 // ADDR 6: OUT (Displays 3)
40 // ADDR 7: HALT (Locks the CPU here)
00 // ADDR 8: Variable (Initial value 0)
01 // ADDR 9: Constant (The number 1)
